{"id":"steam-5366290","steam":5366290,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"ARES: THE IRON VANGUARD","summary":"▣ Stylish Sci-Fi Action RPG ▣\r\n■ Switch combat suits and classes in real time.\r\n■ Master parries, perfect dodges, and powerful combos.\r\n■ Battle massive enemies across vast battlefields with other Guardians.","about":"Suit Up & Change the Flow of Battle.\nTwo combat styles to seamlessly switch between in freeflowing combat. \nA next-level stylish action RPG.\n\n▣ Game Introduction ▣\n■ Suit-Switching: Change the Flow of Battle ■\nSwitch between two suits in real time. Combine weapons and skills to create your own combat style.\nSingle-handedly turn the tide of war, and dominate hordes of enemies in style.\n\n \n■ Wield Multiple Classes in Combat ■\nThe Engineer: fight with heavy gauntlets and deploy drone assaults.\nThe Warlock: unleash AoE magic powered by cosmic energy.\nThe Warlord: brave the front lines with a massive rocket-hammer and shield.\nThe Hunter: cut through the enemy with swift dual blades.\nMulti-class: Mix and match different suits for endless possibilities.\n\n \n\n■ Unmatched Firepower & Mobility ■\nGlide over the open battlefield on a hover board. \nCall down and pilot your Mech: the Goliath. \nReclaim the airspace with the Valkyrie!\n\n \n■ Multiplayer Co-op ■\nExperience the thrill of teamwork-driven combat through raids, strike missions, and more.\nFight end-game bosses with friends.\n\n■ Stylish Action On the Go■\nAn action RPG where timing and skill decide everything!\nExperience console-quality gameplay that combines parries, perfect-dodges, and combos.\n \n■ You’re the Solar System’s Last Hope ■\nA grand journey unfolds across vast battlefields.\nBecome a Guardian fighting against the threat of Nemesis and launch into the center of a new war to protect the solar system.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5366290/dc6db408799f6f6daea0eb3ca6f7a471e2008548/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794207632"